		{"id":"detail-ideate","type":"text","x":-480,"y":200,"width":380,"height":340,"color":"4","text":"## ✓ 💡 Ideate\n\n**Description:** Generate and capture ideas\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Ideas\n- JTBD\n- Problem Statements\n\n---\n\n**Artifacts:**\n\n*Jobs to be Done (3)*\n- Track progress at a glance...\n- Quickly find relevant info...\n\n*Ideas (5)*\n- Dark Mode Support *Active*\n- Multi-language *Active*"},
		{"id":"detail-design","type":"text","x":-80,"y":200,"width":380,"height":340,"color":"3","text":"## ● ✏️ Design **Current**\n\n**Description:** Define requirements and architecture\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Requirements\n- Architecture\n- Wireframes\n\n---\n\n**Artifacts:**\n\n*Requirements (12)*\n- REQ-001: User Login *Approved*\n- REQ-002: Data Export *Proposed*"},
		{"id":"detail-validate","type":"text","x":320,"y":200,"width":360,"height":340,"color":"0","text":"## ○ ✓ Validate\n\n**Description:** Validate assumptions with stakeholders\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Prototypes\n- User Feedback\n- Feasibility Study\n\n---\n\n*No artifacts yet*"},
		{"id":"node-structure","type":"text","x":800,"y":200,"width":400,"height":180,"color":"5","text":"## Node Structure\n\n```\nft-lifecycle-node\n├── ft-lifecycle-circle (60x60)\n│   └── Icon or ✓\n├── ft-lifecycle-name\n└── ft-lifecycle-count\n```\n\n**States:** `.ft-completed`, `.ft-current`, `.ft-pending`"},
		{"id":"events-node","type":"text","x":800,"y":400,"width":400,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"## Event Subscriptions\n\n- `solution.*` → refreshData()\n- `idea.*` → refreshData()\n- `requirement.*` → refreshData()\n- `jtbd.*` → refreshData()"}
